        "subject": "LU-20874 build: fix kfi sym version path",
        "message": "LU-20874 build: fix kfi sym version path\n\nKFI uses a KBUILD_EXTRA_SYMBOLS in own configure checks,\nwith LU-20219 it caused an errors\nERROR: modpost: .. 'kfi_getinfo' exported twice. Previous export was\nwith configure or builds.\nLet's restore an old ksymver path after test to avoid used twice.\n\nFixes: 1692f28e1e (\"LU-20219 osd-zfs: fix symvers paths\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Alexey Lyashkov <alexey.lyashkov@hpe.com>\nChange-Id: I2fc1f2e4325caf46843ce1f91628a40e14bd199d\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/69419\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Alexander Boyko <alexander.boyko@hpe.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\n"
      },
